  (text "Shared 3.072 MHz clock; all SELECT pins grounded. Custom firmware must use the channel order below.\nHead-A CAD targets: 100.000 mm left/right, 63.164 mm front/back along an 11.016 deg tilted plane.\nSee microphone-geometry.json and mic_geometries.fragment.yaml. Outline, package offsets and gaskets remain open."
